1
00:00:00,584 --> 00:00:07,250
Every big business decision starts with a
report. Who to buy from. Where to grow. What
could go wrong.

2
00:00:08,054 --> 00:00:14,040
You could ask an AI. But it makes things up,
runs up the bill, and can't show its work.

3
00:00:15,444 --> 00:00:23,190
Meet the LangGraph Multi-Agent Orchestrator. A
team of AI specialists that writes your
reports — and proves every word.

4
00:00:23,844 --> 00:00:30,030
Send a brief and a budget. Attacks are stopped
at the door — before a cent is spent.

5
00:00:30,484 --> 00:00:38,590
It assembles the right team: a researcher, an
analyst, a compliance expert, a writer — and a
critic who checks every claim.

6
00:00:38,944 --> 00:00:44,490
An AI team lead decides who works next, and
splits the work in parallel when it can.

7
00:00:44,794 --> 00:00:53,140
Promise one: nothing made up. Every quote is
checked against its source. Change twelve
percent to twenty-one — caught.

8
00:00:53,894 --> 00:01:02,240
Promise two: no runaway bills. Before every AI
call, it checks the cost. Over budget? It
stops — and asks you.

9
00:01:03,044 --> 00:01:11,270
Promise three: proof for every word. Each step
is sealed into a chain of receipts. Change one
line — the seal breaks.

10
00:01:11,924 --> 00:01:17,910
The AI does the work. Code enforces the rules.
You make the final call.

11
00:01:18,514 --> 00:01:29,780
Tested on twenty-two briefs it had never seen,
with live AI and the live web. Every quality
bar cleared. Twice. Every attack blocked.
About a cent a report.

12
00:01:30,584 --> 00:01:37,850
And every prompt is versioned and A/B tested —
a change only ships when it beats the one
running today.

13
00:01:38,604 --> 00:01:45,310
This is it running — the live log, the sealed
report, and a review that waits for you.

14
00:01:45,553 --> 00:01:53,580
And it's not one team. Legal, finance, market
research — the same engine builds the team
your field needs.

15
00:01:54,583 --> 00:01:58,810
Designed, built, and measured by Kaarsten
Anderson.

16
00:02:00,579 --> 00:02:07,730
Need AI agents you can trust with real work?
Let's build yours, at kaarstenanderson.com

